    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Denise Radley Auctioneers are delighted to bring to the market this beautifully presented three-bedroom, A-rated semi-detached home, ideally located in the highly sought-after Waters Edge development, within easy reach of Abbeyside Village and Dungarvan Town Centre.\r\n\r\nNo. 12 occupies a quiet corner position within the development and is presented in excellent condition both internally and externally. With its impressive energy rating, air-to-water heating, solar panels and EV car charger, this is a modern, energy-efficient home ready for its new owners to move straight into.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is bright, contemporary and very well laid out. The open-plan living, kitchen and dining area creates a wonderful space for everyday family life and entertaining. The living area features a fitted stove, while double doors from the dining area open directly onto the rear garden.\r\n\r\nA separate utility room provides additional storage and has direct access to the rear. A newly fitted guest WC completes the ground-floor accommodation.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms, with the master bedroom benefiting from its own ensuite. All bedrooms have built in wardrobes. The family bathroom has also been recently upgraded, adding to the excellent overall presentation of the property.\r\n\r\nOne of the standout features of this home is the sun-filled, south-facing rear garden. Designed with low-maintenance living in mind, it features artificial grass and a generous decked area, making it an ideal space for outdoor dining, entertaining and relaxing. There is also a timber garden shed with an electricity supply.\r\n\r\nTo the front, the property provides off-street parking for three cars.\r\nThe location is excellent, offering the peace of a quiet residential development while remaining within walking distance of Dungarvan Town Centre and convenient to Abbeyside Village, schools, shops, cafés, restaurants and local amenities.\r\n\r\nThis is a superb opportunity to acquire a turnkey, A-rated home in one of Dungarvan's most desirable residential locations."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ENTRANCE HALL\r\nKITCHEN/DINING\r\nLIVING ROOM\r\nUTILITY\r\nWC\r\nBEDROOM 1 ENSUITE\r\nBEDROOM 2\r\nBEDROOM 3\r\nFAMILY BATHROOM"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Three-bedroom semi-detached home \r\nThree bathrooms including ensuite \r\nA-rated energy-efficient home \r\nAir-to-water heating \r\nSolar panels \r\nEV car charger \r\nNewly fitted front and rear doors \r\nNewly upgraded family bathroom \r\nNew ground-floor WC \r\nOpen-plan kitchen/dining/living accommodation \r\nFitted stove \r\nUtility room \r\nSouth-facing rear garden \r\nLow-maintenance artificial lawn \r\nLarge decked area \r\nTimber shed with electricity \r\nParking for three cars \r\nQuiet corner position within the development \r\nWalking distance of Dungarvan Town Centre \r\nClose to Abbeyside Village and all local amenities \r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended."
      },
